{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"Flagged and not fixed: RuntimeCaps.max_tool_calls is 60 and the 53ed implementation used 61, so it was truncated mid-task and emitted the TS2339 error the repairs then chased. That is the upstream cause of the repair spiral, and it is a cap-tuning judgement rather than a correctness defect."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789933527791579001,"uuid":"cf0a855e-beb6-4ee3-8a66-42022353bd51"}